          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "വകുപ്പ് (vakuppŭ) is native Dravidian, from the root വക, to divide; DEDR gives the Malayalam noun as a section or kind (DEDR 5202)."
            }
          ]
        },
