              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ശാഖ — śākha — \"a branch office; a branch\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ആ ബാങ്കിന് ഞങ്ങളുടെ ഗ്രാമത്തിൽ ഒരു ശാഖ ഉണ്ട്. ā bāṅkinŭ ñaṅṅaḷuṭe grāmattil oru śākha uṇṭŭ. That bank has a branch in our village."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "In formal Malayalam it is also the branch of a tree; in speech that is a കൊമ്പ്."
            }
          ]
        },
