          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "പ്രവൃത്തിസമയം — pravṛttisamayaṁ — \"office hours; working hours\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ബാങ്കിന്റെ പ്രവൃത്തിസമയം രാവിലെ പത്ത് മുതൽ നാല് വരെയാണ്. bāṅkinṟe pravṛttisamayaṁ rāvile pattŭ mutal nālŭ vareyāṇŭ. The bank's working hours are from ten in the morning to four."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "പ്രവൃത്തി, work, plus സമയം, time. You find it on the board at every office door."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "പ്രവൃത്തിസമയം (pravṛttisamayaṁ) is a Malayalam compound built from two words borrowed from Sanskrit, pravṛtti, \"moving onwards, activity\", and samaya, \"time\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
